g"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M243.31,136,144,36.69A15.86,15.86,0,0,0,132.69,32H40a8,8,0,0,0-8,8v92.69A15.86,15.86,0,0,0,36.69,144L136,243.31a16,16,0,0,0,22.63,0l84.68-84.68a16,16,0,0,0,0-22.63Zm-96,96L48,132.69V48h84.69L232,147.31ZM96,84A12,12,0,1,1,84,72,12,12,0,0,1,96,84Z"></path></svg><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Tags</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">O vocabulário de etiquetas da empresa: onde cada uma é usada e como renomear, juntar ou excluir.</p></div></div></a><a class="block" href="/app/settings/campos-personalizados"><div data-slot="card" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface text-text shadow-xs flex h-full gap-3 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-border-strong"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M168,152a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H96a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h64A8,8,0,0,1,168,152Zm-8-40H96a8,8,0,0,0,0,16h64a8,8,0,0,0,0-16Zm56-64V216a16,16,0,0,1-16,16H56a16,16,0,0,1-16-16V48A16,16,0,0,1,56,32H92.26a47.92,47.92,0,0,1,71.48,0H200A16,16,0,0,1,216,48ZM96,64h64a32,32,0,0,0-64,0ZM200,48H173.25A47.93,47.93,0,0,1,176,64v8a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H88a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V64a47.93,47.93,0,0,1,2.75-16H56V216H200Z"></path></svg><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Campos Personalizados</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Os campos de contato e de negócio da empresa: criar, editar, excluir e ver quanto são preenchidos.</p></div></div></a><a class="block" href="/app/settings/motivos-de-perda"><div data-slot="card" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface text-text shadow-xs flex h-full gap-3 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-border-strong"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M42.76,50A8,8,0,0,0,40,56V224a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V179.77c26.79-21.16,49.87-9.75,76.45,3.41,16.4,8.11,34.06,16.85,53,16.85,13.93,0,28.54-4.75,43.82-18a8,8,0,0,0,2.76-6V56A8,8,0,0,0,218.76,50c-28,24.23-51.72,12.49-79.21-1.12C111.07,34.76,78.78,18.79,42.76,50ZM216,172.25c-26.79,21.16-49.87,9.74-76.45-3.41-25-12.35-52.81-26.13-83.55-8.4V59.79c26.79-21.16,49.87-9.75,76.45,3.4,25,12.35,52.82,26.13,83.55,8.4Z"></path></svg><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Motivos de perda</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">A lista de motivos de perda da empresa, a mesma em todos os funis, com a categoria de cada um.</p></div></div></a><a class="block" href="/app/settings/recursos"><div data-slot="card" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface text-text shadow-xs flex h-full gap-3 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-border-strong"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H128a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h88A8,8,0,0,1,224,128ZM128,72h88a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H128a8,8,0,0,0,0,16Zm88,112H128a8,8,0,0,0,0,16h88a8,8,0,0,0,0-16ZM82.34,42.34,56,68.69,45.66,58.34A8,8,0,0,0,34.34,69.66l16,16a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l32-32A8,8,0,0,0,82.34,42.34Zm0,64L56,132.69,45.66,122.34a8,8,0,0,0-11.32,11.32l16,16a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l32-32a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.32Zm0,64L56,196.69,45.66,186.34a8,8,0,0,0-11.32,11.32l16,16a8,8,0,0,0,11.32,0l32-32a8,8,0,0,0-11.32-11.32Z"></path></svg><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Recursos opcionais</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Tudo o que se liga e desliga, se está ligado e onde se ajusta.</p></div></div></a><a class="block" href="/app/settings/tenant"><div data-slot="card" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface text-text shadow-xs flex h-full gap-3 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-border-strong"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" wi