profile"><div data-slot="card" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface text-text shadow-xs flex h-full gap-3 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-border-strong"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M128,24A104,104,0,1,0,232,128,104.11,104.11,0,0,0,128,24ZM74.08,197.5a64,64,0,0,1,107.84,0,87.83,87.83,0,0,1-107.84,0ZM96,120a32,32,0,1,1,32,32A32,32,0,0,1,96,120Zm97.76,66.41a79.66,79.66,0,0,0-36.06-28.75,48,48,0,1,0-59.4,0,79.66,79.66,0,0,0-36.06,28.75,88,88,0,1,1,131.52,0Z"></path></svg><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Perfil</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Seu nome, idioma, fuso horário e avatar.</p></div></div></a><a class="block" href="/app/settings/security"><div data-slot="card" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface text-text shadow-xs flex h-full gap-3 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-border-strong"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground"><path d="M208,40H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,56v56c0,52.72,25.52,84.67,46.93,102.19,23.06,18.86,46,25.26,47,25.53a8,8,0,0,0,4.2,0c1-.27,23.91-6.67,47-25.53C198.48,196.67,224,164.72,224,112V56A16,16,0,0,0,208,40Zm0,72c0,37.07-13.66,67.16-40.6,89.42A129.3,129.3,0,0,1,128,223.62a128.25,128.25,0,0,1-38.92-21.81C61.82,179.51,48,149.3,48,112l0-56,160,0ZM82.34,141.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L112,148.69l50.34-50.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32l-56,56a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0Z"></path></svg><div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Segurança</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Verificação em duas etapas, códigos de recuperação e sessões.</p></div></div></a><a class="block" href="/app/settings/notifications"><div data-slot="card" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface text-text shadow-xs flex h-full gap-3 p-4 transition-colors hove